Subject: uuid-ossp: add a built-in UUID backend
Last-Update: 2026-09-29

contrib/uuid-ossp is built against one of three UUID libraries. Add a
fourth choice, --with-uuid=builtin, that needs none: versions 3 and 5
were already hashed with pg_cryptohash and only need formatting, version
4 is pg_strong_random bytes, and version 1 follows RFC 4122 with a
random node and clock sequence kept for the life of the process, as
libuuid does without a MAC address or state file.

